OL,3,GNEWSATeenager bled to death after being
OL,4,Astabbed through the heart with zombie
OL,5,Aknife, court told
OL,6,
OL,7,FA teenage boy bled to death in the
OL,8,Fstreet after being stabbed through the
OL,9,Fheart and lung with a 13.5cm (5.3in)
OL,10,Fzombie knife in a frenzied attack, a
OL,11,Fcourt has heard.
OL,13,FGeorgie Mears, 19, from Thornhill,
OL,14,FCardiff, is accused of attacking
OL,15,FTristan Kerr, 17, at a house in Lower
OL,16,FFrancis Street, Abertridwr, Caerphilly,
OL,17,Fin February.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
