OL,3,GNEWSATeenager bled to death after being
OL,4,Astabbed through the heart with zombie
OL,5,Aknife, court told
OL,6,
OL,7,FNewport Crown Court was told on
OL,8,FTuesday, Kerr collapsed in the arms of
OL,9,Fa friend and said: "I'm hurting - my
OL,10,Fside. I love you, bro. You're a good
OL,11,F'un you are."
OL,13,FMears, along with Connor Palfrey, 24,
OL,14,Ffrom Abertridwr, Caerphilly, Ricardo
OL,15,FElliot, 27, of no fixed address, and
OL,16,FElexi Manny, 24, from Senghenydd,
OL,17,FCaerphilly, all deny murder through
OL,18,Fjoint enterprise.
